# BEAT FX on the touch screen. Copy to /opt/xdjaz/bfx.zones (then restart xdjaz) once the
# numbers fit your panel. Coordinates are screen pixels (1024x600 on the 7" panel).
#
# Measure them: set AZ_TOUCH_DEBUG=1 in local.conf, restart, open the BEAT FX panel and tap
# each element; `grep "touch at" /opt/xdjaz/touch/aztouch.log | tail` lists where each
# tap landed.
#
# A touch that comes down in a zone never reaches the player (it is the zone's alone),
# so draw them only over the BEAT FX panel.
#
#   B x0 y0 x1 y1 COMMAND     on    the BEAT FX ON/OFF button
#                             next  the next effect          prev  the previous one
#                             beat+ the next beat (BEAT >)   beat- the previous (BEAT <)
#                             type=N a given effect, N 0..13 (DELAY 0 ... MOBIUS 13)
#   X x0 y0 x1 y1 [v]         the X-PAD: the finger's position along the zone is sent
#                             as 0..255 while it touches (v: vertical, bottom 0, top 255)
#
# Measured and working on the 7" 1024x600 panel with AZ_SCREEN=1024x600 AZ_SCALE8=6 (the
# player's 1280x800 layout drawn at 0.75, its window 31 px from the left edge). The BEAT FX
# panel sits at 1090..1270 x 90..435 in the 1280x800 layout; convert with
#   x = 31 + 0.7508 * x1280      y = 0.75 * y1280
# For another size, scale the same way.
B 849 68 984 88 on         # the "BEAT FX" title
B 849 124 917 159 prev     # left half of the effect's name
B 917 124 984 159 next     # right half
B 849 164 894 197 beat-    # the beat box on the left (3/4 in the layout)
B 940 164 984 197 beat+    # the one on the right
X 849 262 984 306          # the X-PAD PARAMETER strip (1/16 ... 1)

# The same zones for AZ_SCREEN=1024x640 AZ_SCALE8=6.4 (the player's layout at 0.8, its window
# at x 0; the panel squeezes the 640 lines into its 600, no side strips). Use these instead:
# B 872 72 1016 94 on
# B 872 132 944 170 prev
# B 944 132 1016 170 next
# B 872 174 920 210 beat-
# B 968 174 1016 210 beat+
# X 872 280 1016 326

# And for AZ_SCREEN=1024x640 AZ_SCALE8=6 AZ_TOPBAR=40 (the fixed bar of 40 px on top, the player
# at 0.75, 960x600, in the 600 left under it: x = 32 + 0.7508 * x1280, y = 40 + 0.75 * y1280):
# B 850 108 985 129 on
# B 850 164 917 199 prev
# B 917 164 985 199 next
# B 850 204 895 237 beat-
# B 940 204 985 237 beat+
# X 850 303 985 346

# Or, the bar of 28 px (AZ_TOPBAR=28, AZ_SCALE8=6.12: the player at 0.765, 979x612 under it,
# 22 px from the left: x = 22 + 0.765 * x1280, y = 28 + 0.765 * y1280):
# B 856 97 994 118 on
# B 856 154 925 190 prev
# B 925 154 994 190 next
# B 856 195 902 228 beat-
# B 948 195 994 228 beat+
# X 856 296 994 340
